      "writtenOn": "2024-10-11T00:28:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "From what I understand, these tools are whole-program optimizers, and they cannot inline library methods since those need to be loaded at runtime from the appropriate places e.g. to make updates to libraries work as intended.  `ArrayUtils` gets built into `framework.jar` which is a library (used by both system_server and apps), so that applies here.",
